{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the robot to find the shortest path through the portals and destroy the bomb.\u00a0<br><br>The rules are simple: you  pick up the bomb and throw it into the bomb disposer. <br>But every step you make with the bomb is drains you energy. To get the bomb disposer you'll have to take a shortcut. And that's where the portals will help you. You just need to decide which portals to use.<br>\u00a0<br>The game features 70+ hand-drawn puzzles that designed to make you think outside the box and have various unique game mechanics. And, of course, plenty of portals.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553010?t=1755716017","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553010?t=1755716017","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553010/b46194ec7b6faf98e6e24ac0e96896b80675f517/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755716017","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553010/b46194ec7b6faf98e6e24ac0e96896b80675f517/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755716017","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the robot to find the shortest path through the portals and destroy the bomb.\u00a0<br><br>The rules are simple: you  pick up the bomb and throw it into the bomb disposer. <br>But every step you make with the bomb is drains you energy. To get the bomb disposer you'll have to take a shortcut. And that's where the portals will help you. You just need to decide which portals to use.<br>\u00a0<br>The game features 70+ hand-drawn puzzles that designed to make you think outside the box and have various unique game me